### 1. QR Code aanmaken
POST https://digitalworkplacetestapi.runasp.net/api/qrcode/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "TEST001",
  "name": "Test Stop Amsterdam"
}

###

### 2. Alle QR codes ophalen
GET https://digitalworkplacetestapi.runasp.net/api/qrcode/all

###

### 3. Scan registreren (+1)
POST https://digitalworkplacetestapi.runasp.net/api/qrcode/scan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qrCode": "TEST001"
}

###

### 4. Statistieken ophalen
GET https://digitalworkplacetestapi.runasp.net/api/qrcode/statistics/1

###

### 5. Specifieke QR ophalen
GET https://digitalworkplacetestapi.runasp.net/api/qrcode/1

###

### 6. QR code verwijderen
DELETE https://digitalworkplacetestapi.runasp.net/api/qrcode/delete/1

###

### 7. Tweede scan registreren (check +1)
POST https://digitalworkplacetestapi.runasp.net/api/qrcode/scan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qrCode": "TEST001"
}

###

### 8. Alle QR codes opnieuw ophalen (check of TEST001 er nog is)
GET https://digitalworkplacetestapi.runasp.net/api/qrcode/all
